Data Sources
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

The knowledge graph aggregates data from public scientific data sources
(MathXiv / ArxiTeX, PhysicsBabel, ElementKG 2.0, PubChem, Wikidata, Rhea,
ChEBI, ChEMBL, Crossref / OpenAlex, CODATA and others). Such data remains
subject to the terms of its original providers and is NOT relicensed by
this project. The per-source registry with licenses, versions and
redistribution notes is maintained in DATA_LICENSES.md .
